  "content": "<p><strong>Maptip</strong>&nbsp;- 客戶端模組，可在填滿的地圖提示框中直接顯示地圖預覽，以原版風格框架呈現實際地圖內容。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_874dde8d-7b37-451c-b8b2-70871acb6bdd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"425\"></p><p><br>地圖預覽大小可在模組的設定畫面中調整，讓您能依照自己的UI比例與偏好選擇合適的提示框大小。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1353735/description_d5be770f-7e07-43f8-9785-ef2899124e88.jpg\" width=\"495\" height=\"271\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-tooltip\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map Tooltip</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
